00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.540
But for what? Who says there's going to be an addition?

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.510
Just take it.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:40.610
Go ahead.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:47.570
It is exactly 30 minutes since the corrective bombs were detonated.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:53.560
Within the next few hours, the world will know whether this is the end or another beginning,

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:57.350
the rebirth of man or his final obituary.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:03:59.980
For the last time...

