who's gonna give her a job no problem there we'll give her a job while it all still lasts

01:06:45.440 --> 01:06:59.890
we might as well have full employment i felt it necessary to speak to you

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:06.790
If only to stop the many wild and irresponsible rumours precipitated by a general lack of facts.

01:07:07.940 --> 01:07:11.700
There has indeed been a displacement in the direction of the polar axis.

01:07:12.470 --> 01:07:15.380
But it is not a catastrophe, nor is it the millennium.

01:07:16.370 --> 01:07:23.290
Geologists and astronomers have long had evidence that the tilt of the Earth has been altered more than once in the history of its evolution.

01:07:23.930 --> 01:07:25.510
And it has survived them all.

01:07:26.580 --> 01:07:29.040
Now, what does this mean to us in our daily lives?

01:07:30.860 --> 01:07:34.960
some of the seasons as we know them may be disturbed and change their intensity.

01:07:35.360 --> 01:07:42.230
The displacement has undoubtedly brought some regions nearer to the polar circle.

01:07:43.020 --> 01:07:52.360
Others have been carried further from it. But I have the utmost confidence

01:07:52.360 --> 01:07:58.480
the world scientists can produce solutions for any of the climatic problems we are likely to meet.

01:08:00.190 --> 01:08:07.090
I know that many of you are blaming the combined effects of nuclear tests for this disturbance to the motion of the earth.

01:08:07.770 --> 01:08:13.340
I must tell you that the majority of the world's scientists deny that this is the cause.

01:08:15.890 --> 01:08:21.840
I would be failing in my duty if I did not admit to you that there are many others who believe it could have been.

01:08:22.980 --> 01:08:29.960
But whatever the rights, whatever the wrongs, four major powers have now reached unconditional agreement.

01:08:31.560 --> 01:08:37.340
further tests, betterments, manufacture and work projects.

01:08:38.120 --> 01:08:39.240
What they'll do to get votes.

01:08:39.600 --> 01:08:43.140
I ask you now to face the future calmly and constructive,

01:08:44.250 --> 01:08:46.030
remembering that here in Britain, at least,

01:08:46.830 --> 01:08:48.250
weather is something we are used to...

01:08:49.680 --> 01:08:50.840
