01:08:53.740 --> 01:08:55.580
No, leave it on, mate. Let's see the forecast.

01:08:55.970 --> 01:08:57.250
Yes, it's always so right.

01:08:57.650 --> 01:08:59.810
I wouldn't mind the heat of this stupid old fool.

