much it'd cost to get her a good lawyer. Ah, stop worrying. She'll only be in for a week, two at most.

01:09:29.300 --> 01:09:29.980
They're just going through.

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:32.160
But she didn't break the story, Bill, I did.

01:09:32.220 --> 01:09:33.820
If they're going to charge anyone, it should be me.

01:09:34.100 --> 01:09:36.160
So if you brought in the beat of the century...

01:09:37.770 --> 01:09:38.430
What is it, Dick?

01:09:38.610 --> 01:09:40.890
The whole lot's as dry as a bone. They think it's all going up.

01:10:02.680 --> 01:10:03.220
Okay.

01:11:04.250 --> 01:11:09.930
Don't fasten the road. Don't cause obstruction. The road is clear.

01:11:10.830 --> 01:11:13.670
Please keep the road clear. Clear the road, please.

01:12:30.090 --> 01:12:32.850
This is the editorial floor.

01:12:33.510 --> 01:12:35.610
Bandon all hope ye who enter here.

01:12:35.790 --> 01:12:37.340
This is where I work.

01:12:37.590 --> 01:12:39.210
Through the newsroom and down into the library.

01:12:39.700 --> 01:12:42.560
By the way, I'd better warn you about some of these newsroom characters.

01:12:42.840 --> 01:12:43.920
I'm a big girl now.

01:12:44.100 --> 01:12:44.700
That's what I mean.

01:12:44.780 --> 01:12:47.280
Mr. Maguire, if you ever want any extra water...

01:12:47.280 --> 01:12:47.880
Never drink it.

01:12:48.120 --> 01:12:49.240
I mean, I've got a contact.

01:12:49.460 --> 01:12:50.840
Five-gallon drum only costs a pound.

01:12:50.980 --> 01:12:52.720
Great, we'll celebrate with two iced cokes.

01:12:52.860 --> 01:12:54.140
They're fetching four bob apiece now.

01:12:54.280 --> 01:12:54.620
Are they?

01:12:54.780 --> 01:12:55.840
I'll get them soon as I drop these.

01:12:55.940 --> 01:12:57.080
Tell them they're bloody robbers.

01:13:00.250 --> 01:13:02.270
Relax, he's out on a date, if that makes no difference.

01:13:02.960 --> 01:13:03.880
Not to me, it doesn't.

01:13:04.310 --> 01:13:07.310
Look, Jeannie, you can't go on blaming him for blowing that story you gave him.

01:13:07.610 --> 01:13:08.690
Can we change the subject?

01:13:08.950 --> 01:13:10.730
No journalist would have any right not to.

01:13:10.950 --> 01:13:11.370
