01:13:12.130 --> 01:13:15.070
Tell me, do I always come in this way, or is there some sort of tradesman's entrance?

01:13:15.350 --> 01:13:16.530
Yes, I'll mind my own business.

01:13:17.060 --> 01:13:20.070
Now, these are the legal gentlemen, the brothers' prodnos.

01:13:21.500 --> 01:13:22.760
This is the chief bunch here.

01:13:22.980 --> 01:13:25.930
Jacko, Miss Craig, library and standby switchboard.

01:13:26.030 --> 01:13:26.610
Hello, and welcome.

01:13:26.850 --> 01:13:27.150
Thank you.

01:13:27.640 --> 01:13:29.920
